      "prompt": "Is the following an expression, equation, formula, or identity?\n(x + 7)^2 ≡ x^2 + 14x + 49",
      "solution_steps": [
        "Look at the statement: (x + 7)^2 ≡ x^2 + 14x + 49.",
        "Expand the left-hand side fully: (x + 7)^2 expands to x^2 + 14x + 49.",
